  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Empower Your Gear with the Runes of Giants</p></blockquote><p>Rune Knights enhance their martial prowess with the supernatural power of runes, an ancient practice that began with giants. Rune cutters can be found among every family of giants, and you likely learned your methods first- or secondhand from such a mystical artisan. Whether you found a giant's work carved into a hill or cave, learned of the runes from a sage, or met the giant in person, you studied the giant's craft and learned to apply magic runes to empower your equipment.</p><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><h3>Rune Knight Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.VJKixqfWHjyR3eLC]{Bonus Proficiencies}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bB4HGYwkVWra6N0M]{Rune Carver}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.YVdIX4XknliIW4Mc]{Giant's Might}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.IpNDhq5KOb4f0uhN]{Runic Shield}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.0yF4zFynyjyqHrSG]{Great Stature}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jSgft4Ap2uEzBKam]{Master of Runes}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.HZMtkL5BUIRZJ801]{Runic Juggernaut}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
